{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>From afar</b> — this is place, which is the remote cause, for remote causes are many, like the matter of \"Am I Elohim from nearby and not Elohim from afar?\" (Jeremiah 23:23). And some say: it is as its plain meaning: that he will lift up his knowledge and hear from afar."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:35.533896505Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}